          objective: 'Fulfill contract. Rik: 8 tricks with called Ace partner. Solo: 8-13 tricks alone. MisÃ¨re: 0 tricks. Piek: exactly 1 trick.',
          gameplay: '1. Bidding: left of dealer first; must bid higher or pass; three passes ends. 2. Declarer names trump (if applicable), calls Ace for partner (Rik/Rik Beter). 3. Play: follow suit; trump beats non-trump. 4. Scoring: base + overtricks or undertricks.',
          keyRules: [
            'Rik: call Ace for partner; 8 tricks. Rik Beter: hearts always trump.',
            '8-13 Alleen: solo, choose trump. Open variants: hand face-up after first trick.',
            'MisÃ¨re/Piek: no trump. Cards never shuffled between hands.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
